, 32P, 64P} subject to method-specific floors, GPT-style transformer at a representative size (to be narrowed when repo is available). Do not fabricate repo paths, flags, or results. Keep the document self-contained and reviewable.\", \"required_handoff_stage\": \"result\", \"approach_approved\": true}"}], "tool_calls": null, "tool_call_id": null, "name": null}, "llm_response_id": null, "activated_skills": [], "extended_content": [], "sender": null, "kind": "MessageEvent", "source_event_index": 24}
